From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:48:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] drm/msm/a8xx: GPU_CLX_EN_REQ in the TZ request by
 default

msm.a8xx_clx_tz_flag (q90k) defaults to on. It still acts only with
msm.enable_clx=1, and a TZ refusal still falls back to the plain request.

On the OnePlus Pad 4 (A840, vendor GMU 5.3.33) TZ accepts the request,
and in a 60 s glmark2 burst the GPU's current limiting then works as
intended: battery current mean 3.59 -> 3.25 A, peak 3.77 -> 3.45 A, GPU
mean frequency 1.19 -> 1.02 GHz, against CLX without the flag. The owner
switched it on for the installed system (iceland-device 0.28-35 CLX_TZ).

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c
index a879d21c0945..62a1f6e88a4e 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_device.c
@@ -48,9 +48,9 @@ MODULE_PARM_DESC(a8xx_kgsl_bcl,
 		 "A840: enable the GMU battery current limiter (BCL) as KGSL does: TZ BCL request, then HFI_FEATURE_BCL with 62/75/83 % throttle levels (0=off (default), 1=on)");
 module_param(a8xx_kgsl_bcl, bool, 0400);
 
-bool a8xx_clx_tz_flag;
+bool a8xx_clx_tz_flag = true;
 MODULE_PARM_DESC(a8xx_clx_tz_flag,
-		 "A8xx: with msm.enable_clx=1 also set GPU_CLX_EN_REQ in the TZ GPU init request, as KGSL does (0=off (default), 1=on)");
+		 "A8xx: with msm.enable_clx=1 also set GPU_CLX_EN_REQ in the TZ GPU init request, as KGSL does (0=off, 1=on (default))");
 module_param(a8xx_clx_tz_flag, bool, 0400);
 
 bool a8xx_safe_recover = true;
